{"unit_id":"lanscer__dsh-workspace-drag#card-zh","repo":"lanscer/dsh-workspace-drag","commit":"3349fdc2e021aa22c1c612798e11e27ba6275475","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-drag 是一款 DSH Web 插件，可在侧边栏中把对话拖到另一个工作区来整理会话。它接入会话侧栏与设置页面，并通过宿主 HTTP 接口协调浏览器和 DSH 工作区服务。主要功能包括跨工作区拖放迁移、移动前等待会话停止写入、更新会话日志与工作区归属，以及在设置页启用或关闭拖动。适合需要整理多个项目会话的 DSH Web 用户。使用前需要安装 zstd 命令行工具，并由 DSH Web 提供会话和工作区服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:347-439","lib/client.js:493-529","lib/index.js:553-807","lib/index.js:268-302"]}
{"unit_id":"lanscer__dsh-workspace-drag#card-en","repo":"lanscer/dsh-workspace-drag","commit":"3349fdc2e021aa22c1c612798e11e27ba6275475","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-drag lets DSH Web users move conversations between workspaces by dragging them in the sidebar. Host routes relocate session logs and update workspace ownership; settings control dragging. Moves wait for active writes to stop. Requires zstd and DSH session/workspace services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:347-439","lib/client.js:493-529","lib/index.js:553-807","lib/index.js:268-302"]}
