{"unit_id":"lanscer__dsh-workspace-drag#feature-1","repo":"lanscer/dsh-workspace-drag","commit":"3349fdc2e021aa22c1c612798e11e27ba6275475","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-drag 的功能「跨工作区拖动会话」：在侧边栏将会话行拖到另一工作区标题或组内会话行即可迁移。目标区域会高亮，成功后显示提示并刷新工作区列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:347-410","lib/client.js:325-337"]}
{"unit_id":"lanscer__dsh-workspace-drag#feature-2","repo":"lanscer/dsh-workspace-drag","commit":"3349fdc2e021aa22c1c612798e11e27ba6275475","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-drag 的功能「迁移会话存储」：宿主端定位会话日志，改写各代日志头部的工作目录，并将会话目录复制校验后发布到目标工作区，同时同步内存状态和工作区归属。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:553-807"]}
{"unit_id":"lanscer__dsh-workspace-drag#feature-3","repo":"lanscer/dsh-workspace-drag","commit":"3349fdc2e021aa22c1c612798e11e27ba6275475","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-drag 的功能「拖拽开关」：设置页面提供启用复选框，状态通过配置接口读取并保存；关闭时拖拽事件不触发跨工作区迁移。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:453-488","lib/client.js:73-104","lib/index.js:813-847"]}
{"unit_id":"lanscer__dsh-workspace-drag#feature-4","repo":"lanscer/dsh-workspace-drag","commit":"3349fdc2e021aa22c1c612798e11e27ba6275475","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-drag 的功能「等待会话静止」：移动接口可等待 agent 停止运行或日志写入静止，再继续迁移；会话仍在写入时返回相应状态供界面提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:474-500","lib/index.js:849-882","lib/client.js:298-323"]}
{"unit_id":"lanscer__dsh-workspace-drag#caveat-1","repo":"lanscer/dsh-workspace-drag","commit":"3349fdc2e021aa22c1c612798e11e27ba6275475","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-drag 使用前须知：宿主端需要 zstd 命令行工具来读取和改写压缩会话日志；缺少该工具时无法初始化日志处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:268-302"]}
